{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>These are the generations of Noah.</b> His doings and the events of his days." "<b>Righteous.</b> In deed." "<b>Perfect.</b> In his conceptions of the intellect." "<b>In his generations.</b> According to his generations — they were part of the generation of Methuselah and of Lamech and his own, and the generations that his contemporaries produced over four hundred and twenty years." "<b>Noah walked with Elohim.</b> He walked in His ways to do good for others, and he rebuked the people of his generation, according to the words of our Sages of blessed memory. So too wrote about him Eusebius the Chaldean."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {4 "Reading בְּרוּס הַכַּלְדִּיִּי as a reference to Eusebius (ברוס) identified as a Chaldean; the identification is uncertain but the transliteration is rendered as written."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:19.289459007Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}